type: software
title: "DXF-PCI Inspector — French cadastral map viewer"
abstract: "DXF-PCI Inspector: offline browser viewer and field tool for the French cadastral map (DGFiP PCI, DXF). Reads a whole département: parcels, buildings, streets, search, records. Single HTML file."
